# Generated outputs. Only these are ignored, not every png/pdf/json/csv,
# so committed data (e.g. tools/contracts_offline/out/) stays visible to git.
# Plots and flight logs from the scripts in benchmarks/ and demos/:
/outputs/
# Flight logs (demos/simulation_demo.py) and the contract metrics that
# AdaptiveDroneController.save_flight_log writes next to them:
flight_log*.json
*_contracts.json
# LaTeX build output
/thesis/main.pdf

